# Route: guide 39 of 53 of the simulator's completionist route for NightElf
# (1445 of 1459 eligible quests, 164.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 55 to
# 57, 67 quests, 3.1 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Darnassus, The Barrens, Teldrassil, Redridge Mountains, Felwood,
# Darkshore, Westfall, Ironforge, Stormwind City): Craftsmen's Terrace -> near
# Craftsmen's Terrace -> Craftsmen's Terrace -> near Craftsmen's Terrace ->
# The Merchant Coast -> Rut'theran Village -> Lakeshire -> Three Corners ->
# Lakeshire -> Emerald Sanctuary -> Jaedenar -> Felpaw Village -> Emerald
# Sanctuary -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Oh Brother... (167; Foreman
# Thistlenettle 20); Collecting Memories (168; Skeletal Miner 17-18, Undead
# Excavator 17-18, Undead Dynamiter 17-18); Save Techbot's Brain! (2922;
# Techbot 26).
#
# Left out: Return to Nessa (6343): the route takes them here but cannot
# finish them (the coverage report's missed quests).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): In Search of Thaelrid (1198), Twilight Falls (1199),
# Mortality Wanes (1142), Willix the Importer (1144), Blueleaf Tubers (1221),
# Blueleaf Tubers (1221), Deviate Eradication (1487), Deviate Eradication
# (1487), The Glowing Shard (6981), In Search of Thaelrid (1198), Twilight
# Falls (1199), What Comes Around... (386), What Comes Around... (386),
# Songblade Search (95772), Songblade Search (95772), The Defias Brotherhood
# (166), The Defias Brotherhood (166), The Unsent Letter (373), Knowledge in
